# ✨ Animated Glassmorphism Cards

A modern UI project built using HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, and Font Awesome featuring animated gradient backgrounds, glassmorphism cards, and smooth hover effects.

## 🚀 Features
- Animated pastel gradient background  
- Glassmorphism card design (blur + transparency)  
- Smooth fade-in animation on load  
- Floating card motion effect  
- Gradient hover reveal with glow  
- Lift + scale hover animation  
- Responsive Bootstrap grid layout  

