## ▶️ How to Run
1. Download the project  
2. Open `index.html` in browser  
3. Enjoy animations 🎉  


## 🎨 Key Features

### Background Animation
linear-gradient(-45deg, #f8f7ff, #e9e4ff, #dfe7fd, #f5f3ff)

### Glassmorphism Card
rgba(255,255,255,0.4) + backdrop-filter: blur(10px)

### Fade In Animation
Cards smoothly appear using translateY + opacity transition

### Hover Effect
Gradient overlay with blur + lift effect

